": 28.038, "fullText": "galactic space. In those days spirits were brave,", "words": [{"text": "galactic", "start": 24.918, "end": 25.298}, {"text": "space.", "start": 25.298, "end": 26.058}, {"text": "In", "start": 25.938, "end": 26.478}, {"text": "those", "start": 26.478, "end": 26.638}, {"text": "days", "start": 26.638, "end": 26.858}, {"text": "spirits", "start": 26.858, "end": 27.238}, {"text": "were", "start": 27.238, "end": 27.458}, {"text": "brave,", "start": 27.458, "end": 28.038}]}, {"id": 8, "startTime": 28.038, "endTime": 30.538, "fullText": "the stakes were high, men were real men.", "words": [{"text": "the", "start": 28.038, "end": 28.178}, {"text": "stakes", "start": 28.178, "end": 28.378}, {"text": "were", "start": 28.378, "end": 28.598}, {"text": "high,", "start": 28.598, "end": 29.218}, {"text": "men", "start": 29.218, "end": 29.538}, {"text": "were", "start": 29.538, "end": 29.718}, {"text": "real", "start": 29.718, "end": 29.958}, {"text": "men.", "start": 29.958, "end": 30.538}]}, {"id": 9, "startTime": 30.16, "endTime": 33.48, "fullText": "women were real women, and small furry creatures from", "words": [{"text": "women", "start": 30.16, "end": 30.42}, {"text": "were", "start": 30.42, "end": 31.1}, {"text": "real", "start": 31.1, "end": 31.34}, {"text": "women,", "start": 31.34, "end": 31.8}, {"text": "and", "start": 31.8, "end": 32.18}, {"text": "small", "start": 32.18, "end": 32.44}, {"text": "furry", "start": 32.44, "end": 32.76}, {"text": "creatures", "start": 32.76, "end": 33.2}, {"text": "from", "start": 33.2, "end": 33.48}]}, {"id": 10, "startTime": 33.48, "endTime": 36.58, "fullText": "Alpha Centauri were real small furry creatures from Alpha", "words": [{"text": "Alpha", "start": 33.48, "end": 33.78}, {"text": "Centauri", "start": 33.78, "end": 34.36}, {"text": "were", "start": 34.36, "end": 34.58}, {"text": "real", "start": 34.58, "end": 34.86}, {"text": "small", "start": 34.86, "end": 35.12}, {"text": "furry", "start": 35.12, "end": 